{% extends 'layouts/default.twig' %}

{% block content %}
<section class="masthead">
	<div class="container">
		<h1>You're up and running</h1>
		<p>This is the <strong>business</strong> starter: a professional site with Home, About, Services and Contact pages. Replace the placeholder content with your own.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="container">
	<div class="prose">
		<h2>What you have</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Four pages: Home, About, Services, Contact</li>
			<li>A default layout with a top nav and a footer</li>
			<li>Service cards on the homepage and a Services page, both read from the Services collection</li>
			<li>This guide at <code>/readme</code></li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Quick wins</h2>
		<ol>
			<li><strong>Replace placeholder copy</strong> — edit <code>pages/index.twig</code> and friends in <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="/admin/builder">Site Builder</a></li>
			<li><strong>Use Page Data</strong> — open the <em>Home</em> page and put hero text into the <em>Page Data</em> JSON field, then read it as <code>page.data.hero</code> in your template</li>
			<li><strong>Hook up your contact form</strong> — see <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="/admin/docs/forms/overview">Forms docs</a></li>
			<li><strong>Set up your frontend</strong> (optional) — run <code>tcms builder:frontend</code> to install Vite</li>
		</ol>

		<h2>Sample services</h2>
		<p>
			The starter ships with a <code>service</code> schema, a <code>services</code> collection,
			and four service records, each with a picture, so the home page and the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="/services">/services</a> page render
			real content. Edit or replace them under
			<a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="/admin/collections/services">Collections → Services</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>Learn more</h2>
		<ul>
			<li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="/admin/docs/site-builder/overview">Site Builder overview</a></li>
			<li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="/admin/docs/site-builder/admin">Admin UI guide</a></li>
			<li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="/admin/docs/site-builder/twig">Twig functions reference</a></li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
